(339, '917879442720', 'ai', 'Hungary is a great option for students with a budget of 7-14 Lakhs INR. You can study with an IELTS score of 5.5 or even without it. The acceptable gap is 4-5 years for Bachelor\'s and 7-8 years for Master\'s programs. Is there a specific program you\'re interested in?', '2026-06-13 07:40:28', 'whatsapp', NULL),
