(344, '917879442720', 'user', 'Malta', '2026-06-13 07:42:24', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(345, '917879442720', 'ai', 'Malta allows studying with an IELTS score of 5.5 or without it, and the budget is typically 10-15 Lakhs INR. For Master\'s programs, a study gap of 10 to 27 years is acceptable. Are you interested in a particular field or program in Malta?', '2026-06-13 07:42:25', 'whatsapp', NULL),
