(2747, '8801712073638', 'ai', 'Greece is a popular choice for international students. For a student visa, you\'ll need a passport, academic and financial documents, and possibly an embassy interview. Would you like to know about the application process or the requirements?', '2026-07-20 06:33:44', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2748, '8801712073638', 'user', 'Yes', '2026-07-20 06:33:59', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2749, '8801712073638', 'ai', 'For a Greece student visa, you\'ll need to apply about 4–5 months before your intake. The required documents include your passport, financial proof, academic credentials, and accommodation proof. Is there anything specific you\'re curious about, like eligibility or visa success rates?', '2026-07-20 06:34:00', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2750, '8801712073638', 'user', 'Is it possible with MOI for Master’s?', '2026-07-20 06:34:24', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2751, '8801712073638', 'ai', 'Yes, for Master\'s programs in Greece, you can use the Medium of Instruction (MOI) as proof of English proficiency. Would you like more information on the application process?', '2026-07-20 06:34:25', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2752, '8801712073638', 'user', 'How is the costs of overall process?', '2026-07-20 06:35:11', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2753, '8801712073638', 'ai', 'For a Master\'s in Greece, the tuition fees range from €7,500 to €11,000, and living expenses are around €400–€600 per month. There are no application fees, but a registration fee of €300–€400 is required after receiving a Conditional Offer Letter. Do you have a specific budget in mind for your studies?', '2026-07-20 06:35:13', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2754, '8801712073638', 'user', 'I\'ve total 10 lakh budget. Is it enough?', '2026-07-20 06:35:53', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2755, '8801712073638', 'ai', 'With a budget of 10 lakh BDT, Greece could be a feasible option for you, considering tuition and living expenses. Do you have any questions about the next steps or how to apply?', '2026-07-20 06:35:55', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2756, '8801712073638', 'user', 'Yes, what\'s the next steps?', '2026-07-20 06:36:21', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2757, '8801712073638', 'ai', 'The next steps involve gathering your academic documents, preparing your financial statements, and applying to the universities. After securing an offer, you\'ll apply for your student visa. Would you like to talk to a counselor for more detailed guidance?', '2026-07-20 06:36:23', 'whatsapp', NULL),
