(2865, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'Thanks for sharing your academic details! Given your SSC and HSC GPAs, you may be eligible for Foundation Programmes in Greece. Once your BBS result is out, it can further strengthen your application. Would you like to book an appointment with a counselor to discuss this further? If yes, please let me know your preferred consultation type (Office, Phone, or WhatsApp) and a date/time. 😊', '2026-07-20 08:29:13', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2866, '8801791634013', 'user', 'Tell me about foundation program', '2026-07-20 08:29:41', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2867, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'Foundation Programs in Greece are designed to help students meet the entry requirements for Bachelor\'s degrees. They usually focus on improving language skills and preparing students for higher education. What\'s your full name?', '2026-07-20 08:29:43', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2868, '8801791634013', 'user', 'I didn\'t have much idea about that', '2026-07-20 08:29:50', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2869, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'No problem, I\'m here to help! Foundation Programs often focus on language and academic skills to prepare you for a Bachelor\'s degree. They accept MOI or equivalent English certificates. Could you share your full name with me, please? 😊', '2026-07-20 08:29:53', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2870, '8801791634013', 'user', '!', '2026-07-20 08:30:28', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2871, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'No worries! Whenever you\'re ready, feel free to share your name or any other questions you have. 😊', '2026-07-20 08:30:31', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2872, '8801791634013', 'user', 'Doing foundation program is necessary?\nOr I just apply and have offer letter from university!', '2026-07-20 08:31:29', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2873, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'For direct admission to Bachelor\'s or Master\'s programs in Greece, you would typically need to meet the English proficiency requirement. The Foundation Program is a good option if you need to improve your language skills or academic readiness. Would you like to discuss which option suits you best with a counselor? If so, let me know your preferred consultation type and time. 😊', '2026-07-20 08:31:31', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2874, '8801791634013', 'user', 'Is there any way to skipping foundation program', '2026-07-20 08:32:48', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2875, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'Yes, if you meet the English proficiency and academic requirements, you might be eligible to apply directly for Bachelor\'s or Master\'s programs. Do you have an IELTS or equivalent score to share?', '2026-07-20 08:32:50', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2876, '8801791634013', 'user', 'I didn\'t have ielts', '2026-07-20 08:33:08', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2877, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'That\'s okay! You can still apply using MOI (Medium of Instruction) or another accepted English proficiency proof. What\'s your budget for studying abroad?', '2026-07-20 08:33:10', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2878, '8801791634013', 'user', 'But my English proficiency is good \nI hope so', '2026-07-20 08:33:50', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2879, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'That\'s great to hear! Many programs accept MOI as proof of your English proficiency. What\'s your budget for studying abroad?', '2026-07-20 08:33:51', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2880, '8801791634013', 'user', '15-16 lakh', '2026-07-20 08:34:08', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2881, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'With a budget of 15-16 Lakhs, you have several options like Greece, Cyprus, or Estonia. Do you have any preference among these countries?', '2026-07-20 08:34:14', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2882, '8801791634013', 'user', 'Tell me about estonia', '2026-07-20 08:34:36', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2883, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'Estonia is a beautiful country with a growing reputation for quality education. For Bachelor\'s programs, you typically need an IELTS score of 5.5, while Master\'s programs require a 6.0. The budget ranges from 10-14 Lakhs. Does this sound like a good fit for you?', '2026-07-20 08:34:39', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2884, '8801791634013', 'user', 'I think it\'s sengen right', '2026-07-20 08:34:48', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2885, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'Yes, Estonia is part of the Schengen Area, which allows for travel across many European countries. Would you like to proceed with more information on studying there?', '2026-07-20 08:34:49', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2886, '8801791634013', 'user', 'Are they accept without ielts ?', '2026-07-20 08:35:18', 'whatsapp', NULL),
(2887, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'For Estonia, IELTS is generally required: 5.5 for Bachelor\'s and 6.0 for Master\'s programs. However, it\'s best to check if specific programs might accept alternatives. Would you like help with anything else?', '2026-07-20 08:35:20', 'whatsapp', NULL),
