(2895, '8801791634013', 'ai', 'For Schengen countries without IELTS, Slovakia or Romania might be good options. They accept MOI (Medium of Instruction) as proof of English proficiency. Would you like more details on either of these?', '2026-07-20 08:38:01', 'whatsapp', NULL),
