(308, 9001, 30, 'Cold Lead', '{\"reasoning\":\"The student has completed a bachelor\'s degree but with a low GPA, which might limit opportunities for further education in Greece without additional qualifications or compensatory strengths. The lack of an English proficiency test score is a significant barrier since most Greek universities require proof of English language proficiency. Furthermore, without a specified budget, it\'s challenging to assess the financial feasibility of studying abroad. These factors combined with the absence of a specific course of interest and uncertainty about passport availability place the student in the \'Cold Lead\' category. However, the absence of a study gap and no history of visa refusals are positive aspects that can be built upon with further preparation.\",\"risks\":[\"Low GPA in bachelor\'s degree\",\"No English proficiency test score\",\"Unspecified budget\",\"No specific course selected\",\"Uncertain passport availability\"],\"strengths\":[\"No study gap mentioned\",\"No prior visa refusals\"],\"next_steps\":[\"Recommend taking an English proficiency test (IELTS/PTE) and scoring at least the minimum required by Greek institutions.\",\"Identify and select a specific course of interest for better alignment with educational and career goals.\",\"Clarify budget to assess affordability and financial planning for studies in Greece.\",\"Ensure a valid passport is available for visa application.\"]}', 'ai', '2026-07-21 09:24:12'),
